"""The nested map Page: the parts of the Page component of the systemap map.

The atlas page shows this map when the reader goes into the card Page. The actors are the
components of the parent map that have a flow with Page. A flow between two parts gives its
source records and its review digest. A flow with an actor has the artifact of the flow
of the parent map. All values are literal values, so systemap reads this file without running it."""

